          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "విహరించు — vihariñcu — \"to stroll; to roam for pleasure\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "పర్యాటకులు తోటలో హాయిగా విహరించారు. paryāṭakulu tōṭalō hāyigā vihariñcāru. The tourists strolled happily in the garden."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Past (I …): విహరించాను, vihariñcānu."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "A rather literary verb; విహారయాత్ర, an excursion, holds the same root."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "విహరించు (vihariñcu) is built from Sanskrit vihāra, \"roaming, pleasure\" (CDIAL 12033), from vi-hṛ, \"to roam about\", with the Telugu verb ending -ఇంచు."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
